:: Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'deadwood-casino-street'>>
	<<if $exposed lte 0 and !$possessed>>
		<<icon 'casino.png'>>
		<<if maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.open>>
			<<lanLink ['Gambling room (0:02)', '赌馆 (0:02)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<pass 2>><</lanLink>>
		<<else>><span class='blue'><<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				The gambling room upstairs is closed until 18:00.
			<<option 'CN'>>
				楼上的赌馆要到 18:00 才开门。
		<</language>></span><</if>><br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-casino-balance'>>
	<<icon 'casino-chips.png'>><<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			Chips: <span class='gold'>£<<print Number((maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.chips / 100).toFixed(2))>></span>.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			你有价值 <span class='gold'>£<<print Number((maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.chips / 100).toFixed(2))>></span> 的筹码。
	<</language>><br>
	<<set $_chipStacks to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.chipStacks>>
	<<for $_index, $_stack range $_chipStacks>>
		<<if $_index gt 0>>
		  ·
		<</if>>
		<span class='gold'>£<<= Number(($_stack.value / 100).toFixed(2))>></span> × <<= $_stack.count>>
	<</for>><br>
	<<if maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.chips gte 1000000>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				The cashier pushes the smaller piles aside and counts out the high-value chips. A dealer looks up from the nearest table.
			<<option 'CN'>>
				柜员把零散的筹码推到一旁，点出几枚大额筹码。最近那张桌子的荷官抬头看了你一眼。
		<</language>><br>
	<</if>><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-casino-exchange'>>
	<<set $_exchange to {amount: Number(_args[0]), method: _args[1]}>>
	<<if maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.exchange($_exchange.amount, $_exchange.method)>>
		<<money `-$_exchange.amount` 'deadwoodCasino' `{recordOnly: $_exchange.method === 'bank'}`>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-casino-cashout'>>
	<<set $_cashOutMethod to _args[0] || 'cash'>>
	<<set $_cashOutAmount to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.cashOut($_cashOutMethod)>>
	<<if $_cashOutAmount gt 0>>
	  <<money $_cashOutAmount 'deadwoodCasino' `{recordOnly: $_cashOutMethod === 'bank'}`>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-casino-cashier'>>
	<<set $_casino to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino>>
	<<deadwood-casino-balance>>
	<<lanSwitch 'Cash: ' '现金：'>><span class='gold'>£<<print Number(($money / 100).toFixed(2))>></span>
		<<if $_casino.bankAvailable>>
		  · <<lanSwitch 'Bank: ' '银行存款：'>><span class='teal'>£<<print Number(($VanillaPlus.finance.bank.balance / 100).toFixed(2))>></span>
		<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<set $_methods to {}>>
	<<set $_methods[lanSwitch('Cash', '现金')] to 'cash'>>
	<<if $_casino.bankAvailable>>
	  <<set $_methods[lanSwitch('Bank account (debit card)', '银行账户（借记卡）')] to 'bank'>>
	<</if>>
	<label><<lanSwitch 'Payment: ' '结算方式：'>>
		<<listbox '_cashier.method' autoselect>><<optionsfrom $_methods>><</listbox>>
	</label><br>
	<<if $_casino.available>>
		<label><<lanSwitch 'Amount: ' '兑换金额：'>><<listbox '_cashier.amount' autoselect>><<optionsfrom _cashier.amounts>><</listbox>></label><br><br>
		<<icon 'casino-exchange.png'>><<lanLink ['Exchange for chips', '兑换筹码']>>
			<<if maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.canExchange(_cashier.amount, _cashier.method)>>
				<<deadwood-casino-exchange _cashier.amount _cashier.method>>
				<<replace '#deadwood-casino-cashier'>><<deadwood-casino-cashier>><</replace>>
				<<replace '#deadwood-casino-cashier-result'>><span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'The cashier hands you the chips.' '柜台后的人把筹码递给你。'>></span><</replace>>
			<<else>>
				<<replace '#deadwood-casino-cashier-result'>><span class='blue'><<lanSwitch 'You do not have enough money for that exchange.' '你没有足够的钱兑换这笔筹码。'>></span><</replace>>
			<</if>>
		<</lanLink>><br>
	<<else>><br><</if>>
	<<if $_casino.chips gt 0 or $_casino.holdem.state.joined>>
		<<icon 'casino-redeem.png'>><<lanLink ['Redeem all chips', '兑回全部筹码']>>
			<<deadwood-casino-cashout _cashier.method>>
			<<replace '#deadwood-casino-cashier'>><<deadwood-casino-cashier>><</replace>>
			<<replace '#deadwood-casino-cashier-result'>><span class='green'><<lanSwitch `_cashier.method === 'bank' ? 'Your chips have been returned to your bank account.' : 'The cashier counts your cash into your hand.'` `_cashier.method === 'bank' ? '筹码已兑回你的银行账户。' : '柜台后的人把兑回的现金点到你手里。'`>></span><</replace>>
		<</lanLink>><br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-casino-table-action'>>
	<<set $_turn to {mode: _args[0], action: _args[1], amount: Number(_args[2]), accepted: false, chips: 0, minutes: 0}>>
	<<if $_turn.mode is 'holdem'>>
		<<set $_game to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.holdem>>
		<<switch $_turn.action>>
			<<case 'join'>>
				<<set $_turn.accepted to $_game.join($_turn.amount)>>
				<<if $_turn.accepted>>
				  <<set $_turn.chips to -$_turn.amount>>
				<</if>>
			<<case 'deal'>>
				<<set $_turn.accepted to $_game.deal()>>
				<<if $_turn.accepted>>
				  <<set $_turn.minutes to 2>>
				<</if>>
			<<case 'cashout'>>
				<<set $_turn.accepted to $_game.state.joined>><<set $_turn.chips to $_game.cashOut()>>
			<<default>>
				<<set $_turn.accepted to $_game.act($_turn.action, $_turn.amount)>>
				<<if $_turn.accepted>>
				  <<set $_turn.minutes to 1>>
				<</if>>
		<</switch>>
	<<elseif $_turn.mode is 'three'>>
		<<set $_game to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.threeCard>>
		<<switch $_turn.action>>
			<<case 'ante'>>
				<<set $_game.ante to $_turn.amount>>
			<<case 'start'>>
				<<set $_turn.accepted to $_game.start()>>
				<<if $_turn.accepted>>
				  <<set $_turn.chips to -$_game.state.ante>><<set $_turn.minutes to 2>>
				<</if>>
			<<default>>
				<<set $_turn.cost to $_game.act($_turn.action, $_turn.amount)>>
				<<set $_turn.accepted to $_turn.cost gte 0>>
				<<if $_turn.accepted>>
				  <<set $_turn.chips to -$_turn.cost>><<set $_turn.minutes to $_turn.action is 'look' ? 0 : 1>>
				<</if>>
		<</switch>>
		<<if $_turn.accepted>>
		  <<set $_turn.chips += $_game.collectPayout()>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $_turn.accepted>>
		<<if $_turn.chips isnot 0>>
		  <<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.adjustChips($_turn.chips)>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $_turn.minutes gt 0>>
		  <<pass $_turn.minutes>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<set _casino to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino>>
<<if !_casino.open>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			The lights upstairs are off. <span class='blue'>The gambling room is closed.</span> A cleaner carries a bucket through the open door. The room opens at <span class='gold'>18:00</span> and closes at <span class='gold'>04:00</span>.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			楼上的灯已经熄了。<span class='blue'>赌馆已经关门。</span>一名清洁工提着水桶走进敞开的门。赌馆在 <span class='gold'>18:00</span> 开门，<span class='gold'>04:00</span> 关门。
	<</language>><br><br>
<<elseif $id lte 0>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			You climb the narrow stairs above the bar. A bouncer holds out a hand. "ID, please. Same rule as downstairs." You offer your school card, but it is handed straight back. "Legal ID only." The bouncer points you towards the stairs.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			你沿着狭窄的楼梯来到酒吧楼上。一名保安伸出手。“请出示身份证。和楼下一样。”你递出学生证，对方却立刻还了回来。“这里只接受合法身份证。”保安示意你下楼。
	<</language>><br><br>
<<elseif _casino.barred>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>Marlow points towards the cashier. "<span class='red'>No more cards tonight.</span> You can still collect your remaining chips."
		<<option 'CN'>>马洛指了指筹码柜台。“<span class='red'>今晚不准再玩了。</span>剩下的筹码，你仍然可以兑回。”
	<</language>><br><br>
	<<if _casino.canTalk>>
		<<lanLink ['Speak to Marlow', '与马洛说话'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Marlow Talk'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
	<<elseif _casino.canReply and _casino.state.chat_topic and !_casino.state.chat_reply and _casino.state.last_chat_night is _casino.state.guest_night>>
		<<lanLink ['Finish talking to Marlow', '继续与马洛说话'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Marlow Conversation'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<deadwood-marlow-bribe>>
<<elseif !_casino.available>>
	<span class='blue'><<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			You are in no condition to play. The bouncer steps aside to let you return to the stairs.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			你现在的状态不适合玩牌。保安让开身，让你返回楼梯。
	<</language>></span><br><br>
<<else>>
	<<initnpc 'Marlow'>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			You enter the gambling room above the bar on Connudatus Street. The music downstairs is muffled here. Three card tables are covered in green cloth, with a slot machine against the far wall. A bouncer stands by the stairs, watching the guests. Behind a narrow counter, the cashier stacks chips in a tray.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			你走进康努达塔斯街酒吧楼上的赌馆。楼下的音乐声在这里听不太清。三张牌桌铺着绿毡，远处墙边摆着一台老虎机。一名保安站在楼梯旁，观察着客人。狭窄的柜台后，收银员把筹码整齐地码进托盘。
	<</language>><br><br>
	<<if !_casino.state.met_dealer>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				The dealer straightens a deck of cards and turns to you. "I'm <span class='gold'>Marlow</span>. We play for chips here. Check the stakes before you sit down." Marlow taps the rules card. "No arguing over them afterwards."
			<<option 'CN'>>
				荷官把一副牌理齐，转向你。“我叫<span class='gold'>马洛</span>。这里用筹码下注，入座前先看清赌注。”马洛敲了敲桌上的说明牌。“别等打完才来争论。”
		<</language>><br><br>
		<<set _casino.state.met_dealer to true>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Marlow.rage gt 0>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>Marlow checks the deck before looking up. "You know the rules. <span class='purple'>Keep your hands to your own cards.</span>"
			<<option 'CN'>>马洛检查完牌堆，才抬起头。“规矩你已经知道了。<span class='purple'>手只碰自己的牌。</span>”
		<</language>><br><br>
	<<elseif _casino.state.good_shifts gte 5>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				Marlow glances at you, then at the occupied tables. "Playing tonight, or taking a shift?"
			<<option 'CN'>>
				马洛看了你一眼，又看看坐满人的牌桌。“今晚来玩，还是来接班？”
		<</language>><br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if _casino.wrenPresent>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				Wren sits at one of the card tables, leaning back while another player counts out a bet. Wren notices you watching and grins.
			<<option 'CN'>>
				伦恩坐在一张牌桌旁，靠着椅背，看另一名客人数出下注的筹码。注意到你的视线，伦恩朝你咧嘴一笑。
		<</language>><br>
		<<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Approach Wren', '走近伦恩'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Wren'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if _casino.landryPresent>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				Landry sits at a table by the wall, with an untouched drink. A person in a coat sits opposite, speaking quietly. Neither has any chips in front of them.
			<<option 'CN'>>
				兰德里坐在墙边的桌旁，面前的酒还没喝过。一个穿外套的人坐在对面，低声说着什么。两人面前都没有筹码。
		<</language>><br>
		<<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Greet Landry', '向兰德里打招呼'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Landry'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			Red lamps light the room. Servers in fitted uniforms carry drinks between the tables, holding their trays clear of the players' cards.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			红色灯光照亮了房间。穿着贴身制服的服务员端着托盘，在牌桌间穿行，小心避开客人的牌。
	<</language>><br><br>
	<<deadwood-casino-atmosphere>>
	<<deadwood-casino-balance>>
	<<icon 'casino-cashier.png'>><<lanLink ['Visit the cashier', '前往筹码柜台'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Cashier'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
	<<icon 'poker-chips.png'>><<lanLink ["Texas hold'em table", '德州扑克牌桌'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Holdem'>><</lanLink>><br>
	<<icon 'blackjack.png'>><<lanLink ['Three-card poker table', '炸金花牌桌'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Three Card'>><</lanLink>><br>
	<<icon 'blackjack.png'>><<lanLink ['Blackjack table', '二十一点牌桌'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Blackjack'>>
		<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.blackjack.prepare('casino', null, 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino')>>
	<</lanLink>><br>
	<<icon 'slot-machine.png'>><<lanLink ['Slot machine', '老虎机'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Slot Machine'>><</lanLink>><br>
	<<icon 'dealer.png'>><<lanLink ['Talk to Marlow', '与马洛交谈'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Dealer'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
	<<icon 'casino-lounge.png'>><<lanLink ['Go to the lounge', '前往休息区'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Lounge'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<if !_casino.available and (_casino.chips gt 0 or _casino.holdem.state.joined)>>
	<<icon 'casino-cashier.png'>><<lanLink ['Visit the cashier', '前往筹码柜台'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Cashier'>><</lanLink>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<if _casino.chips gt 0 or _casino.holdem.state.joined>>
	<span class='blue'><<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>You can keep your chips when you leave. Take them to the cashier to exchange them for cash or have the money sent to your bank account.
		<<option 'CN'>>离开时，你可以保留筹码。想换成现金或转入银行账户，请到柜台兑换。
	<</language>></span><br><br>
<</if>>
<<connudatusicon>><<lanLink ['Leave (0:02)', '离开 (0:02)'] 'Connudatus Street'>><<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.leave()>><<endevent>><<pass 2>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Cashier []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<set _cashier to {amount: maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.options.exchanges[0], method: 'cash', amounts: {}}>>
<<for _amount range maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.options.exchanges>>
	<<set _cashier.amounts['£' + Number((_amount / 100).toFixed(2))] to _amount>>
<</for>>
<<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		The cashier points to the tray. "Cash or debit card. We exchange the chips at face value, both ways. You can redeem them here or keep them for another night. If you leave a table in the middle of a hand, you give up the chips you've already bet."
	<<option 'CN'>>
		收银员指了指托盘。“现金、借记卡都收，筹码按面值兑换，换回去也一样。你可以在这里兑回，也可以留到下次来玩。不过牌局中途离席，已经下注的筹码就拿不回来了。”
<</language>><br><br>
<div id='deadwood-casino-cashier'><<deadwood-casino-cashier>></div>
<div id='deadwood-casino-cashier-result' role='status'></div><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Holdem []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		Marlow stacks the chips beside the deck. "Two cards each, five in the middle. You play with the chips you have in front of you. No buying more until the hand is over." The dealer button lies next to the cards.
	<<option 'CN'>>
		马洛把筹码码在牌堆旁。“每人两张底牌，中间五张公共牌。只能用你面前的筹码下注，这局结束前不能再买入。”庄位标记放在牌旁。
<</language>><br><br>
<<deadwood-casino-balance>><<deadwood-holdem-table>><<deadwood-casino-tricks>>
<<if !maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.available>><span class='blue'><<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		The table cannot continue. You can still return your remaining chips to the counter.
	<<option 'CN'>>
		牌桌现在无法继续。你仍可收回剩余筹码，再去柜台兑回。
<</language>></span><br><br><</if>>
<<icon 'dealer.png'>><<lanLink ['Read the table rules', '查看牌桌规则'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Holdem Rules'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Three Card []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		Marlow places three cards face-down in front of each seat. "You can bet without looking," the dealer says. "Once you look, you pay twice the blind stake. If you want to compare cards, pay for that too."
	<<option 'CN'>>
		马洛在每个座位前放下三张朝下的牌。“可以不看牌就下注。”荷官说。“看过牌以后，要付暗牌注额的两倍。想跟别人比牌，也得先付筹码。”
<</language>><br><br>
<<deadwood-casino-balance>><<deadwood-three-card-table>><<deadwood-casino-tricks>>
<<if !maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.available>><span class='blue'><<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		The table cannot continue. You may leave, giving up the chips already committed.
	<<option 'CN'>>
		牌桌现在无法继续。你可以离席，放弃已经投入的筹码。
<</language>></span><br><br><</if>>
<<icon 'dealer.png'>><<lanLink ['Read the table rules', '查看牌桌规则'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Three Card Rules'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave the table', '离开牌桌'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.threeCard.leave()>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Holdem Rules []
<<nobr>>
<<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		The card on the table reads:<br><br>
		"Choose your buy-in. The small and big blinds are shown in brackets."<br><<deadwood-poker-stakes 'holdem'>><br>"The button moves one seat after every hand. Both opponents bring their own chips. A player who runs out is replaced before the next hand."<br><br>
		<b>Dealing and betting</b><br>"Each player receives two private cards. Bet before the flop, then after three community cards, the fourth card and the fifth. After the flop, the first active seat left of the button acts first. Check when nobody has bet, call to match, raise or fold. A raise must increase the current bet by at least the last full raise, and an opening bet must be at least the big blind."<br><br>
		<b>All-in and side pots</b><br>"You may go all-in with fewer chips. A short all-in cannot reopen raising for someone who has already acted, unless the increases faced together reach a full raise. An all-in player can only win pots funded by their own contribution. Excess, uncalled bets are returned. No money can be added during a hand."<br><br>
		<b>Hand rankings</b><br>"Use the best five of your two cards and the five community cards. From high to low: straight flush, four of a kind, full house, flush, straight, three of a kind, two pair, pair, high card. A2345 is the lowest straight. Suits do not break ties. Identical best hands split each eligible pot; odd pennies go clockwise from the button."<br><br>
		<b>Settlement and leaving</b><br>"The house takes five percent of contested pots, capped at three big blinds per hand. Uncalled money is not charged. Leaving during a hand folds your cards and returns your remaining chips to your casino balance. Take them to the counter to exchange them for cash or return them to your bank."
	<<option 'CN'>>
		桌上的说明牌写着：<br><br>
		“选择买入金额，括号内依次为小盲与大盲。”<br><<deadwood-poker-stakes 'holdem'>><br>“每局结束，庄位顺时针移动一位。对手自带筹码，输光的人在下一局前换人入座。”<br><br>
		<b>发牌与下注</b><br>“每人两张底牌。翻牌前下注，随后依次发三张公共牌、第四张和第五张，每次发牌后再下注。翻牌后，从庄位左边仍在牌局中的人开始行动。无人下注时可以过牌。有人下注时可以跟注、加注或弃牌。加注至少增加上次完整加注的数额，首次下注至少为大盲。”<br><br>
		<b>全下与边池</b><br>“筹码不足时可以全下。小额全下不会让已经行动过的人重新获得加注权，除非累计增加的数额达到一次完整加注。全下者只能争夺自己出资覆盖的底池。没人跟注的超额筹码退回，一局内不能追加买入。”<br><br>
		<b>牌型大小</b><br>“从自己的两张底牌与五张公共牌中选最强五张。由大到小：同花顺、四条、葫芦、同花、顺子、三条、两对、一对、高牌。A2345 是最小顺子，花色不分大小。最强手牌相同则平分各自有资格争夺的底池，分不尽的便士从庄位左侧起顺时针分配。”<br><br>
		<b>结算与离席</b><br>“赌馆从有人争夺的底池抽取 5%，每局最多三个大盲。未被跟注而退回的钱不抽水。一局中途离席视为弃牌，剩余筹码会退回给你。到柜台可兑回现金，也可转回银行账户。”
<</language>><br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the table', '返回牌桌'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Holdem'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Three Card Rules []
<<nobr>>
<<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		The dealer points out this table's rules. "Three cards each. No jokers. Choose an ante from the listed amounts before the deal."<br><span class='gold'><<language>><<option 'EN'>>Ante: <<option 'CN'>>底注：<</language>></span><<deadwood-poker-stakes 'three'>><br><br>
		<b>Betting</b><br>"You can play blind or look at your own cards for free. A seen hand pays twice the current blind stake. A raise doubles the blind stake, up to eight times the ante. You cannot borrow or go into debt. If you cannot pay, fold."<br><br>
		<b>Comparing and showing cards</b><br>"After looking, pay twice your usual call to compare with one opponent. The weaker hand folds. If the cards are identical, the person requesting the comparison loses. The other player's cards are shown only to you. If two players remain, play continues; after ten rounds, everyone still in shows and the strongest hand wins."<br><br>
		<b>Hand rankings</b><br>"Three of a kind beats straight flush, then flush, straight, pair and high card. AKQ is the highest straight, A23 the lowest. Suits do not break ties. <span class='gold'>An unsuited 235 beats any three of a kind.</span> Against other hands, it counts as high card. A suited 235 is just a flush. If several players show together, an unsuited 235 knocks out the three-of-a-kind hands first. We then compare the remaining hands as usual. Matching best hands split the winnings, with odd pennies assigned in seat order."<br><br>
		<b>Settlement and leaving</b><br>"Five percent is taken from the final pot, capped at three antes. The winnings include the winner's own stake and return to the casino chip balance. Leaving an unfinished hand gives up the chips already in the pot."
	<<option 'CN'>>
		荷官指了指本桌的规则。“每人三张牌，不用鬼牌。发牌前选好底注。”<br><span class='gold'><<language>><<option 'EN'>>Ante: <<option 'CN'>>底注：<</language>></span><<deadwood-poker-stakes 'three'>><br><br>
		<b>下注与加注</b><br>“可以暗牌下注，也可以免费查看自己的牌。看过牌的人支付当前暗牌注额的两倍。加注会把暗牌注额翻倍，最多为底注的八倍。不赊账，不借钱。付不起就弃牌。”<br><br>
		<b>比牌与摊牌</b><br>“看牌后，可以支付自己跟注金额的<span class='gold'>两倍</span>，与一名对手比牌。较弱的一方弃牌。牌型与点数完全相同，主动比牌者输。对手的牌只向你展示。若还剩两人则继续下注，十轮后仍未弃牌的人摊牌，最强者获胜。”<br><br>
		<b>牌型大小</b><br>“豹子大于顺金，其后依次为金花、顺子、对子、单张。AKQ 为最大顺子，A23 最小，花色不分大小。<span class='gold'>杂色 235 能吃任何豹子。</span>碰到其他牌，仍算普通单张。同花 235 只算金花。多人一起摊牌时，有杂色 235 就先淘汰豹子，剩下的人再按普通牌型比。最强牌相同则平分奖金，零头按座位顺序分配。”<br><br>
		<b>结算与离席</b><br>“最终底池抽水 <span class='gold'>5%</span>，最多三个底注。奖金包含赢家自己投入的筹码，牌局结束后加到你的筹码里。未结束的牌局中途离席，放弃已经投入底池的筹码。”
<</language>><br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the table', '返回牌桌'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Three Card'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

